WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.066 --> 00:00:00.667
ALL THE WAY DOWN AT THE END.

00:00:02.869 --> 00:00:04.771
- MM-HMM.

00:00:04.938 --> 00:00:06.706
- YOU HAVE YOUR OWN ATTACHED
BATHROOM, BY THE WAY.

00:00:06.873 --> 00:00:08.742
OH, UM, HERE'S ONE
OF OUR BEST RESEARCHERS.

00:00:08.908 --> 00:00:10.243
DICK?
- HEY.

00:00:10.410 --> 00:00:12.145
- AH, HELLO THERE.

00:00:12.312 --> 00:00:14.881
[dramatic music]
WHAT'S UP, DUDE?

00:00:15.048 --> 00:00:17.117
GLAD TO SEE
THERE'S ANOTHER BROTHER

00:00:17.283 --> 00:00:19.219
IN THIS STUFFY PLACE.

00:00:19.386 --> 00:00:22.989
- SO, UH, THIS IS GONNA BE
YOUR ASSISTANT, GENEVIEVE.

00:00:23.156 --> 00:00:24.657
[dramatic music]
- WHAT IS THIS?

00:00:24.824 --> 00:00:26.626
- IT'S THE SHINING, MAN.

00:00:26.793 --> 00:00:28.695
ALL BLACK PEOPLE
HAVE THE SHINING.

00:00:28.862 --> 00:00:30.630
YOU NEVER SHINED WITH
ANOTHER BLACK PERSON BEFORE?

00:00:30.797 --> 00:00:32.699
- NO, I GREW UP

00:00:32.866 --> 00:00:34.501
IN A WHITE NEIGHBORHOOD
AND THEN WENT TO DARTMOUTH.

00:00:34.667 --> 00:00:35.668
I'VE MET
OTHER BLACK PEOPLE BEFORE,

00:00:35.835 --> 00:00:37.804
BUT NOT LIKE THIS.

00:00:37.971 --> 00:00:40.140
- YOU GOTTA GET SHINED AT
BY ANOTHER BLACK PERSON FIRST,

00:00:40.306 --> 00:00:42.475
AND THEN YOU GET IT.
IT'S KINDA LIKE FACEBOOK.

00:00:45.278 --> 00:00:48.381
[dramatic music]
- WHAT UP, DUDES?

00:00:48.548 --> 00:00:49.816
- SO EVERY BLACK PERSON
HAS THIS?

00:00:49.983 --> 00:00:51.651
IS KOBE LISTENING?

00:00:51.818 --> 00:00:52.952
- [voice of Kobe Bryant]
YO, WHAT UP?

00:00:53.119 --> 00:00:54.988
- WOW! DENZEL WASHINGTON?

00:00:55.155 --> 00:00:56.689
- [voice of Denzel Washington]
I'M HERE, I'M PRESENT,

00:00:56.856 --> 00:00:57.724
AND I WILL ALWAYS
BE AROUND.

00:00:57.891 --> 00:00:59.392
- LIL JON?

00:00:59.559 --> 00:01:01.394
- [voice of Lil Jon]
YEAH!

00:01:01.561 --> 00:01:02.495
- [voice of Barack Obama]
EXCUSE ME, LIL JON.

00:01:02.662 --> 00:01:04.230
WELCOME, RAY.

00:01:04.397 --> 00:01:06.066
I'M GLAD TO HAVE YOU
ON BOARD.

00:01:06.232 --> 00:01:08.468
- OH, [bleep]!
WHAT'S UP, BARACK OBAMA?

00:01:10.470 --> 00:01:12.105
AHEM!

00:01:12.272 --> 00:01:14.274
[chuckles]

00:01:14.441 --> 00:01:16.276
WOULDN'T THAT BE SOMETHING
IF BARACK OBAMA JUST SHOWED UP?

00:01:18.278 --> 00:01:21.081
- YOUR START-UP PAPERWORK'S
RIGHT OVER HERE.

00:01:21.247 --> 00:01:22.615
[dramatic music]
- MAN, YOU GOTTA BE

00:01:22.782 --> 00:01:24.117
MORE CAREFUL.

00:01:24.284 --> 00:01:25.919
LEARN TO USE THE SHINING.

00:01:26.086 --> 00:01:27.921
TUNE IN AND OUT OF IT.
OTHERWISE,

00:01:28.088 --> 00:01:30.290
YOU WON'T BE ABLE
TO SORT OUT WHO'S TALKING.

00:01:30.457 --> 00:01:31.958
- AND I'M SICK OF THESE
GODDAMN SNAKES...

00:01:32.125 --> 00:01:33.226
- JUST GIVE ME
THE BASKETBALL!

00:01:33.393 --> 00:01:35.195
- ON THIS GODDAMN PLANE!

00:01:35.361 --> 00:01:37.097
- HERE, YO, COCO, WHAT
YOU WANT TO DRINK, GIRL?

00:01:37.263 --> 00:01:38.865
- LEO, WHAT ARE YOU DOING?

00:01:39.032 --> 00:01:40.767
- DRINK SOME COLT 45
MALT LIQUOR.

00:01:40.934 --> 00:01:42.869
[overlapping voices]
- WOMEN DIG CHOCOLATE!

00:01:43.036 --> 00:01:44.904
- IS EVERYTHING OKAY?

00:01:45.071 --> 00:01:47.140
[dramatic music]
- RAY!

00:01:47.307 --> 00:01:49.609
LISTEN FOR MORGAN.
MORGAN FREEMAN.

00:01:49.776 --> 00:01:51.711
HE WILL GUIDE YOU.

00:01:51.878 --> 00:01:53.913
- [voice of Morgan Freeman]
LISTEN TO MY VOICE, RAY.

00:01:54.080 --> 00:01:58.051
NOW, JUST STAY CALM
AND FOCUS ON THAT WHITE MAN.

00:01:58.218 --> 00:02:00.153
- [exhales]

00:02:00.320 --> 00:02:02.322
EVERYTHING'S
GOING TO BE OKAY.

00:02:02.489 --> 00:02:04.124
- ONCE YOU FINISH UP
THIS PAPERWORK,

00:02:04.290 --> 00:02:05.825
BRING IT TO JENNIFER
IN MY OFFICE.

00:02:08.528 --> 00:02:11.097
- [voice of Morgan Freeman]
NOW, PICK UP THAT LETTER OPENER,

00:02:11.264 --> 00:02:14.434
AND KILL THAT WHITE MAN.

